          Accepted Qualifying Tests &amp; Prior Evidence Guidelines
        </h2>
        <p>
          Many candidates qualify for high-IQ societies without taking an official in-person admissions test through a process known as <strong>Ранее сданные тесты</strong>. High-IQ organizations recognize standardized examinations administered during school or university admissions, provided the test possessed sufficient psychometric general factor (g-factor) saturation and standardized national norms during the administration year.
        </p>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 my-6 not-prose">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead class="bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/70 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 font-mono text-xs border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
